# Agent Base Rules

Always use `AGENTS.md` at the repository root as the base rule set for this project.

- Read `AGENTS.md` before making edits in this repository.
- Follow its conventions unless the user explicitly overrides them.
- When guidance conflicts, prefer `AGENTS.md` for repository-specific style, layout, testing, and workflow decisions.
- When creating or editing `.cursor/rules/`, keep rules generic and portable unless the user explicitly asks for solution-specific rules. Use placeholders, not production names from this repository.